{
  "$schema": "../../../../packages/shared/schema/animation-scene.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "c-03-state",
  "title": {
    "tr": "State: Davranış Duruma Göre Değişir",
    "en": "State: Behavior Changes with State"
  },
  "summary": {
    "tr": "Order bağlamı pay/ship/cancel çağrılarını içindeki durum nesnesine devreder; Pending → Paid → Shipped geçişleri durum sınıflarında yaşar; Shipped durumda cancel reddedilir.",
    "en": "The Order context delegates pay/ship/cancel to its current state object; the Pending → Paid → Shipped transitions live in the state classes; cancel is rejected in Shipped."
  },
  "a11y": {
    "description": {
      "tr": "Solda istemci, ortada Order bağlamı, sağda üstten alta Pending, Paid ve Shipped durum nesneleri. İstemci pay çağırır; Order bunu Pending'e devreder; Pending bağlamın durumunu Paid yapar. İstemci ship çağırır; Paid durumu Shipped yapar. İstemci cancel çağırır; Shipped durumu bunu reddeder.",
      "en": "Client on the left, the Order context in the middle, Pending, Paid and Shipped state objects stacked on the right. The client calls pay; Order delegates to Pending; Pending sets the context state to Paid. The client calls ship; Paid sets it to Shipped. The client calls cancel; Shipped rejects it."
    }
  },
  "canvas": {
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 600
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "OrderApi",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 150,
      "h": 70,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "pay / ship / cancel",
        "en": "pay / ship / cancel"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "order",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "Order #42",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 80,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "state: Pending",
        "en": "state: Pending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pending",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "PendingState",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 120,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 60,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "pay → Paid",
        "en": "pay → Paid"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paid",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "PaidState",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 60,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "ship → Shipped",
        "en": "ship → Shipped"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shipped",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "ShippedState",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 480,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 60,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "cancel → hata",
        "en": "cancel → error"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "c-o",
      "from": "client",
      "to": "order",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "pay()"
    },
    {
      "id": "o-pending",
      "from": "order",
      "to": "pending",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "state.pay(this)",
      "curvature": -0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "o-paid",
      "from": "order",
      "to": "paid",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "state.ship(this)"
    },
    {
      "id": "o-shipped",
      "from": "order",
      "to": "shipped",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "state.cancel(this)",
      "curvature": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "pay",
      "title": {
        "tr": "1. pay(): Pending → Paid",
        "en": "1. pay(): Pending → Paid"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "OrderApi order.pay() çağırır. Order içinde switch(status) yoktur; this.state.pay(this) der. PendingState ödemeyi işler ve order.setState(new PaidState()) yapar: geçiş kuralı durumun içindedir.",
        "en": "OrderApi calls order.pay(). There is no switch(status) in Order; it says this.state.pay(this). PendingState processes the payment and does order.setState(new PaidState()): the transition rule lives inside the state."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "inherit": false,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "client",
          "order",
          "pending"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "c-o",
          "o-pending"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "pending": {
          "status": "active"
        },
        "paid": {
          "status": "muted"
        },
        "shipped": {
          "status": "muted"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "o-paid": {
          "status": "muted"
        },
        "o-shipped": {
          "status": "muted"
        }
      },
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-o",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "pay()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "o-pending",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "state.pay(this)",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "o-pending",
          "startAt": 1800,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "setState(Paid)",
          "durationMs": 800
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a1",
          "x": 450,
          "y": 170,
          "text": {
            "tr": "Order'da switch yok: devret",
            "en": "no switch in Order: delegate"
          },
          "target": "order"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ship",
      "title": {
        "tr": "2. ship(): Paid → Shipped",
        "en": "2. ship(): Paid → Shipped"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Durum artık PaidState. ship() çağrısı ona gider; kargo oluşturulur ve durum ShippedState olur. Aynı order.ship() çağrısı Pending durumda \"önce ödeme\" hatası verirdi: aynı mesaj, farklı davranış.",
        "en": "The state is now PaidState. ship() goes to it; a shipment is created and the state becomes ShippedState. The same order.ship() call in Pending would have raised \"pay first\": same message, different behavior."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "paid"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "c-o",
          "o-paid"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "order": {
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "state: Paid",
            "en": "state: Paid"
          }
        },
        "pending": {
          "status": "idle"
        },
        "paid": {
          "status": "active"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "c-o": {
          "label": "ship()"
        },
        "o-paid": {
          "status": "active"
        },
        "o-pending": {
          "status": "idle"
        }
      },
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-o",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "ship()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "o-paid",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "state.ship(this)",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "o-paid",
          "startAt": 1800,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "setState(Shipped)",
          "durationMs": 800
        }
      ],
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel",
      "title": {
        "tr": "3. cancel(): Shipped durumda geçersiz",
        "en": "3. cancel(): invalid in Shipped"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Müşteri iptal ister. ShippedState.cancel() InvalidTransition fırlatır: kargoya verilmiş sipariş iptal edilemez, iade süreci başlatılmalı. Yeni bir durum (Returned) eklemek yeni bir sınıf demektir; diğer durumlar değişmez.",
        "en": "The customer requests cancellation. ShippedState.cancel() throws InvalidTransition: a shipped order cannot be cancelled, a return flow must start. Adding a new state (Returned) means a new class; other states do not change."
      },
      "durationMs": 4000,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "shipped"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "c-o",
          "o-shipped"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "order": {
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "state: Shipped",
            "en": "state: Shipped"
          }
        },
        "paid": {
          "status": "idle"
        },
        "shipped": {
          "status": "error",
          "badge": "✕"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "c-o": {
          "label": "cancel()"
        },
        "o-shipped": {
          "status": "error"
        },
        "o-paid": {
          "status": "idle"
        }
      },
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-o",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "cancel()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "o-shipped",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "o-shipped",
          "startAt": 1800,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "danger",
          "label": "InvalidTransition",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "c-o",
          "startAt": 2700,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "danger",
          "label": "409",
          "durationMs": 700
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a3",
          "x": 450,
          "y": 440,
          "text": {
            "tr": "durum × olay tablosu sınıflara dağıldı; her sınıf kendi satırı",
            "en": "the state × event table is spread over classes; each class owns its row"
          },
          "tone": "info",
          "target": "order"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "loop": false,
  "defaultSpeed": 1,
  "tags": [
    "state",
    "behavioral"
  ]
}
